<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>40 days of Orivraa Pro on us</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;background:#f8fafc;color:#1f2937;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6"
  >
    <div style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 18px">
      <div
        style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:16px;padding:32px"
      >
        <p style="margin-top:0">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p>
          Recently, some Orivraa customers experienced problems with checkout,
          invoices, and account-related workflows. If this interrupted your
          work, I’m genuinely sorry.
        </p>
        <p>
          We fixed the affected workflows and added real-time error monitoring
          and alerts so we can detect problems much faster. Our target is to
          begin investigating a new customer-impacting report within 24 hours.
        </p>
        <p>
          To make up for the inconvenience, we would like to give
          <strong>{{shopName}}</strong>
          <strong>{{days}} days of Orivraa Pro</strong>
          at no cost. No card is required and it will not renew automatically.
        </p>
        <p style="margin:28px 0;text-align:center">
          <a
            href="{{claimUrl}}"
            style="display:inline-block;border-radius:10px;background:#b7791f;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700"
          >
            Claim my
            {{days}}
            days
          </a>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#6b7280">
          This account-bound offer expires on
          {{formatDate offerExpiresAt}}. If anything does not work, reply
          directly to this email or contact
          {{supportEmail}}.
        </p>
        <p>
          We will not pretend software can never fail. What we can promise is
          that we will listen, investigate quickly, and keep you informed.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0">— Aakash<br />Founder, Orivraa</p>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center">
        You received this service-recovery message because an error report was
        linked to your signed-in Orivraa account.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>